[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/dont tell me what to dot.wav, next=auto]  Don’t tell me what to do!  I have to get out of here!  I think I just have to use W A S and D and I can escape this place! [#voice=uid://b65p88w6tgrjx]

