~ onExitHut

[color=grey]Old Man[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/You have nothing.wav, next=auto] You have nothing to be scared of, Zed.  I will take care of you. [#voice=uid://n3i8kqt1ftg0]
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/i dont know who you are.wav, next=auto]  I don’t even know who you are!  I don’t even know WHERE you are!!  Or where I am!!! How can I trust you?? [#voice=uid://ccmqotgtbrbuw]
[color=grey]Old Man[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/Look at your map.wav, next=auto]  Look at your map and follow the arrow that appears to me, and we can talk.  I brought you here for safety. [#voice=uid://bh2hutvw68ubi]
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/im not sure.wav, next=auto]  ...I'm still not sure... [#voice=uid://bh55fwxkgbq6n]
[color=grey]Old Man[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/Trust me.wav, next=auto]  Trust me, Zed.  I'll explain it all once you get over here. [#voice=uid://dloosymas5jvu]
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.5, voice=res://zooLevels/FirstLevel/okay.wav, next=auto]  Okay... [#voice=uid://c1abxfckj3gtg]

